"text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 10, "type": "RSLT"}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "engenn8le08ob08re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Do you leave your shoes on or off when you enter a house? Let's write about customs or manners.", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le08ob08re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le08ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le08ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le08ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Fancy meeting you here!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hi Justin.  I haven't seen you for ages.  Hows the family?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Pam and the twins are great. They started primary school last month. We had thought they might not be ready but they are enjoying their new routine. What about you?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Actually, I'm waiting for my date to arrive ..."}, {"time": "20250", "image": "engenn8le08ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Still on the dating scene, eh? How long have you been waiting?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Half an hour. She must be trying to tell me something.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Oh don't say that. She might be stuck in traffic or she could be trying to find a park somewhere. It's a zoo after work.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Maybe ...\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Or it may be the weather if she is using public transport. I heard that the subway is delayed due to water on the tracks at Bloom Station.  How well do you know her?"}, {"time": "49200", "image": "engenn8le08ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: This is only our second time out together. Come to think of it, she was an hour late for our first date too! We had tickets to baseball game and missed the first five innings. The game had almost ended before she sauntered in.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Ouch! If I had waited for an hour and a half, there would not have been another date.  And you still invited her out a second time?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I thought I might give her another chance. She's in the same field and highly ambitious.  Plus, she's very attractive.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Well, I'm meeting up with friends for drinks and to watch the NFL playoffs on the big screen. You must join us!"}, {"time": "87000", "image": "engenn8le08ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks buddy! I might sit here near the door for a bit.  I'm starting to think that I'll be spending the evening with the guys. Pretty or not, making someone wait is just plain rude.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: I'll shout you a drink ...  WAITER.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh here she comes now. 45 minutes late? I wonder what the excuse will be this time."}]}}]}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "5000", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "Manners and Customs"}, {"time": "26800", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What customs are important in America?</span>"}, {"time": "87000", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What customs are important in your country?</span>"}, {"time": "101000", "image": "", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Topic sentence</span>"}, {"time": "120000", "image": "", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Supporting sentences</span>"}, {"time": "137000", "image": "", "id": 6, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Concluding sentence</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn8le08ob08re3vid01"}}], "_data": [], "id": 2, "type": "video"}]}], "type": "sena"}